<https://hexplain.io/ns/conf#RangeDatatypeShape> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Validation activation: subjects using conf:assertion, conf:findingMessage, conf:message Constraints apply only within that activation or through shape references; they are not global OWL domain axioms."@en .
